 "notes": [
  "Car textures are WebP (EXT_texture_webp) and geometry is meshopt-compressed (EXT_meshopt_compression + KHR_mesh_quantization): load with GLTFLoader + MeshoptDecoder; no Draco. Source textures were all <=1024 px so nothing needed downscaling.",
  "Models are metres, +Y up, nose toward +Z, car left = +X. mp45 is ~1.69x oversize (7.33 m long).",
  "mp45 wheels: wheel_front_L/R and wheel_rear_L/R pivots sit on the axle centre; spin about local X.",
  "Part roles in models.mp45.parts[] are heuristic (material, parent, position) and were not render-checked.",
  "NonCommercial licences (RB19, 911, Vantage; also ShareAlike) restrict commercial use of the site.",
  "portrait.webp is landscape (1280x853, man holding a drone), not a portrait crop.",
  "theta-shell-cut skipped: the render has a pale grey disc behind the model that a white-key cut left ragged. theta-cart-cut and theta-hub-cut are clean.",
